:"広島市内出身だけどお好み焼き屋めちゃ多いからなあ\nよく行ってたところはとろろ昆布が入ってた","ts":"1633242005.469100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K4GqE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d8313ad-0109-44c3-bfe1-f84adfb2d3f7","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":sorena: :point_up:","ts":"1633236273.466200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w9s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f7b4d2f-2105-4268-b1bf-ef8808f6493e","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"地元の味、ってやつの凄いところは、多分ですけど高いレベルでの競争力だと思うんですよねぇ。\n広島のお好み焼き屋さんは切磋琢磨で旨い店が山ほどあるし、香川もしかり。\nその中からよそに輸出してきてくれる店が出てくれるのは嬉しいことですわ…","ts":"1633236197.465900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ky="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdee4cf1-2d95-4351-9326-5af689904a1e","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"笑","ts":"1633236063.464400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"udfX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6655fa9-294e-414c-a5dc-8f48ce5cd78d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"香川出身なので当時うどん教室でうどんのつくりかた学んだし、今日も粉をさきほどこねてました (ただしパンだけど・・・)","ts":"1633236057.464200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"clap","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UHYdv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a66ab3bb-ecba-469a-80a5-d24c8e3c6f62","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"香川で食べて、衝撃を受けて、神保町丸香に心底の感謝を注いでます","ts":"1633236049.463900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/FF8Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99f8f5fc-68f7-409b-acfd-5d4896d6e817","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"Vancouverはまだ一件しかないのでもっとがんばってほしい (そしてその一件は偉い)","ts":"1633236023.463100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"dele