ich_text","block_id":"JCHGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06f9b486-22ae-4e3e-a817-29d9a517b2cf","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あと僕は広島いくときは観光客なので豚と牡蠣両方のせちゃいます","ts":"1633235694.458800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jkA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd9d990b-8f41-46ff-a7e2-09f70acb796a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"餅最高","ts":"1633235671.458300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DCc1u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FCEA3C25-716A-406A-9CC6-F8133A713D45","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"トッピングに餅を入れることをオススメします","ts":"1633235617.458100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i/N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a9546de-6e6a-498b-971c-2c98894e21d9","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"\u0026gt; ちなみにいっぱいなのはキャベツではなくもやし\n自分の広島のお好み焼きのイメージと違ってて、ますます広島で食べてみたくなりました。:-)","ts":"1633235540.457600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JPU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2E0A18A1-A425-4835-BB8A-E4B6A4360253","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ちなみにいっぱいなのはキャベツではなくもやし（1枚につき1パックがデフォ）だったりします（キャベツも入りますけど","ts":"1633235447.456000","thread_ts":"1633235288.452600","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mi+=3"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"39f30488-e90f-46b0-bf43-73ea3241acf6","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"\u0026gt; 広島のお好み焼き、めん入りがデフォルトですよ\nそうなんですね。キャベツがいっぱいのイメージしかなかった。\nいつか、広島で食べてみたい。","ts":"1633235288.452600","thread_ts":"1633235288.452600","edited":{"user":"U022E2B9KRD","ts":"1633235381.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M5Q5J"}]}},{